  "title": "Qualify immutable Foundation local NuGet publisher on a disposable feed with five source-free binary checks",
  "commitMessage": "test: qualify Foundation immutable NuGet publisher rehearsal",
  "timeoutSeconds": 1800,
  "projectNodes": [
    "M0"
  ],
  "contribution": {
    "summary": "Rehearse the immutable Foundation NuGet publisher using seven actual commands, five independent binary identity checks and collision/digest/cancellation refusals in a disposable feed only.",
    "value": "Reuse pinned Dw.Tools.NuGet to build the exact one-source Foundation project in a temporary packing projection, publish/read back its new rehearsal archive, and prove zero dependencies without mutating NUGET_LOCAL.",
    "debtChanges": [
      "RS150 original Foundation candidate is 3863 bytes with distinct original archive and DLL SHA-256; a rebuilt rehearsal archive is not a permitted replacement.",
      "Actual private feed publication, replacement and installed rollback are excluded; owner must explicitly invoke guarded modes after separate successful DWF delivery.",
      "Preserve 541 completed roadmap nodes, original source Version 0.1.0-preview.1, five published Math packages, and previous F1-F17 authority; public licensing and external adoption remain open.",
      "RS151 preselection invocation 001 failed before attempt allocation: the payload used a stale Markdown heading and RS148 owner guard name. Both exact text assertions were repaired without changing the run objective."
    ],
    "nextAction": "After successful RS151, obtain owner authorization for separate --publish and --verify of original Foundation archive bytes; then prepare independent DWF physical-feed readback.",
    "achievements": []
  },
